                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b069af2-d45c-3e28-b8d0-93aefe8ea8f8",
                        "entry_id": "05b3816c-ccdd-3c44-aa97-750efe7871d4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "hide and seek (a game)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "312afdbf-e5ae-405d-b6a9-320f9dde6d42",
                                "sense_id": "7b069af2-d45c-3e28-b8d0-93aefe8ea8f8",
                                "text": "На дворе́ и в саду́ бы́ло мно́жество ую́тных закоу́лков, как бу́дто наро́чно для игры́ в пря́тки.",
                                "translation": "In the yard and garden there were many comfortable little nooks, which seemed to have been specially made for hide-and-seek.",
                                "english": "In the yard and garden there were many comfortable little nooks, which seemed to have been specially made for hide-and-seek."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
